      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Walter Maxwell West Sr. (July 14, 1904 in Sunset, Texas – April 25, 1971 in Houston, Texas), was a professional baseball player who played outfielder in the Major Leagues for the Brooklyn Robins during the 1928 and 1929 baseball seasons. He attended the University of North Texas.",
